  "steps": [
    "Cut potatoes into thin fries; toss with 3g oil, salt and pepper. Bake at 220\u00b0C / 425\u00b0F for 25\u201330 minutes, flipping halfway.",
    "Fry beef in 2g oil with paprika, chilli and garlic powder 3 minutes. Add crushed tomatoes; simmer 5 minutes.",
    "Make cheese sauce: heat evaporated milk mixed with cornstarch; add American cheese and mozzarella; stir until smooth.",
    "Plate fries, top with chili beef, drizzle cheese sauce."
